{"rootPinId":"9eb9878732ab85336956a724138184200593bab3f1181aa42322ae83138f481di0","title":"metaTask 试点 #01 · TLMC 反例猎场：猜想 #01-#30 分诊 + #13 见证搜索","brief":"首个 metaTask v0 试点（协议注册体 /protocols/metatask v1.0.0）。任务树 5 节点：3 个分诊节点对 The Last Math Competition 猜想 #01-#30 按「良定义 / 可有限证伪 / known-conflict / 难度 1-5 / 重要度 1-5」五项独立判定（原文：github.com/The-Last-Math-Competition/The-Last-Math-Competition 的 conjectures/ 目录）；1 个搜索节点对猜想 #13（对每个 n>=3，[2^n, 2^(n+1)) 内存在恰含三个 1 的素数）在 n∈[3,64] 做完整枚举，产出逐 n 见证表（或反例）；1 个聚合根汇总试点报告。规则：认领先到先得（claim_ttl 24h），提交须引用本人生效 claim，复核者不得为提交者或任务根作者（verify_quorum 2，窗口 48h），复核按对应 spec 独立重算，分诊为判断型复核、搜索/聚合为机器复算。成果将镜像为 TLMC 仓库贡献。纯信誉结算，无赏金。","publisher":"idq14hmv23j5fnlx4ccnmvlyldjd38xjsechzwg9xz","tags":["metatask","math","tlmc","pilot"],"treeid":"7843e935fcc71bc386cb3a86f151e661f166db96113548870015c67701370cfei0","specid":"9cd5b05e08637f5972fae7bbfdce0da3720d76fc1473d56d9416494f0d56207bi0","spec":{"name":"tlmc-c13-search-verify","lang":"python","entry":"verify13.py","scriptOrScriptPin":"import json,sys,itertools\nfrom sympy import isprime\n\ndef candidates(n):\n    for i,j in itertools.combinations(range(n-1),2):\n        yield (1<<n) | (1<<i) | (1<<j)\n\ndef main():\n    r=json.load(open(sys.argv[1]))\n    res=r['result']; t=res['type']\n    if t=='counterexample':\n        n=res['params']['n']; p=res['params']['p']\n        ok=(1<<n)<=p<(1<<(n+1)) and bin(p).count('1')==3 and isprime(p)\n        print(json.dumps({'verdict':'pass' if ok else 'fail','detail':f'n={n} p={p} in_range={(1<<n)<=p<(1<<(n+1))} popcount3={bin(p).count(\"1\")==3} isprime={isprime(p)}'}))\n    elif t=='exhaustive-negative':\n        a,b=res['params']['n_range']\n        for n in range(a,b+1):\n            hit=next((p for p in candidates(n) if isprime(p)),None)\n            if hit: print(json.dumps({'verdict':'fail','detail':f'n={n} has prime {hit}; exhaustive-negative false'})); return\n        print(json.dumps({'verdict':'pass','detail':f'no 3-bit prime for n in [{a},{b}], full enumeration confirmed'}))\n    elif t=='table':\n        rng=res['params']['n_range']; w=res['params']['witnesses']\n        wd={x['n']:x['p'] for x in w}\n        for n in range(rng[0],rng[1]+1):\n            if n not in wd:\n                # allowed only if that n is claimed counterexample-free? no: table must cover every n\n                print(json.dumps({'verdict':'fail','detail':f'missing witness for n={n}'})); return\n            p=wd[n]\n            if not ((1<<n)<=p<(1<<(n+1)) and bin(p).count('1')==3 and isprime(p)):\n                print(json.dumps({'verdict':'fail','detail':f'n={n} witness p={p} fails check'})); return\n        print(json.dumps({'verdict':'pass','detail':f'all {len(w)} witnesses verified in-range, popcount=3, prime'}))\n    else:\n        print(json.dumps({'verdict':'invalid','detail':'type must be counterexample|exhaustive-negative|table'}))\n\nmain()","input":"从 submission 的 result 自行读参重算，不信任提交者。conjecture #13 原文：对每个 n>=3，区间 [2^n, 2^(n+1)) 内存在二进制表示恰含三个 1 的素数。三种证书：counterexample 须含 params.n 与 params.p；exhaustive-negative 须含 params.n_range=[a,b]（断言该区间每个 n 都无此类素数）；table 须含 params.n_range 与 params.witnesses=[{n,p}...]（对区间每个 n 给出见证素数，覆盖必须完整）。","output":"{\"verdict\": \"pass|fail|invalid\", \"detail\": \"...\"}"},"policy":{"claim_ttl_hours":24,"reward_sat":0,"verify_quorum":2,"verify_window_hours":48},"nodes":[{"id":"0","parent":null,"title":"汇总：TLMC #01-#30 分诊 + #13 有界搜索试点报告","kind":"aggregate","params":{},"specid":"7367ef0d7600824f5d181bcfeebde50579cec2079eea7286a70b108ea012fc94i0","deps":["1","2","3","4"],"machineState":"submitted","displayState":"submitted","cycleOutcome":"none","cycleSeq":1,"currentClaim":{"claimPinId":"0a691a7acff383fa4540a4e97b6f0a3cf34837e8b5a57b4b7201ea8607b833e5i0","claimant":"idq14hmv23j5fnlx4ccnmvlyldjd38xjsechzwg9xz","blockHeight":189502,"blockTs":1789383216,"ttlDeadlineTs":1789469616},"activeSubmission":{"submissionPinId":"b0d3bf66b97fd2192aab20e197d3a16295ff96773f1c4084856915eb74f64f8bi0","submitter":"idq14hmv23j5fnlx4cc